<title>BELGIUM: EU details oilseeds crop projections to 2005/06.</title>
<headline>EU details oilseeds crop projections to 2005/06.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union oilseeds production and yields are expected to develop as follows between 1996/97 and 2005/06, the European Commission's agriculture directorate general said in a working document released on Wednesday.</p>
<p>	     EU-15 oilseeds production ('000 tonnes)</p>
<p>			   1996/97    1997/98    2000/01    2005/06</p>
<p>    Rapeseed	   7,008	7,304	7,831	7,921</p>
<p>    Sunflowerseed    4,131	3,906	3,731	3,827</p>
<p>    Soybeans	   1,018	1,144	1,061	1,079</p>
<p>    Total Oilseeds  12,157     12,354     12,623     12,826</p>
<p>     -incl food     10,710     11,067     10,215     10,402</p>
<p>     -non-food	 1,447	1,287	2,408	2,425</p>
<p>     Set-aside rate 10 pct	5 pct   17.5 pct   17.5 pct</p>
<p>	     EU oilseed yield forecasts per oilseed (tonnes/ha)</p>
<p>    Rapeseed	    2.62	 2.68	 2.71	 2.77</p>
<p>    Sunflowerseed     1.65	 1.61	 1.61	 1.62</p>
<p>    Soybeans	    3.07	 2.99	 3.02	 3.07</p>
<p>    Total Oilseeds    2.21	 2.23	 2.27	 2.30</p>
<p>--Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
